{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leegahuyn/MathScopeCompute/pulls/15","id":4825780989,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU_XS4s8AAAABH6OS_Q","html_url":"https://github.com/leegahuyn/MathScopeCompute/pull/15","diff_url":"https://github.com/leegahuyn/MathScopeCompute/pull/15.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/leegahuyn/MathScopeCompute/pull/15.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leegahuyn/MathScopeCompute/issues/15","number":15,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement and verify all 64 M3 criteria, including P7","user":{"login":"leegahuyn","id":102484661,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhvKtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102484661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn","html_url":"https://github.com/leegahuyn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegahuyn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem and scope\n\nThe published M3 workspaces lacked P7 arithmetic/complex continuation and source-connected Gauge/Fluid execution evidence. The user expanded the request to all 64 original M3 criteria, including P7.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Add all 13 bounded P7 calculation kinds, exact arithmetic descent/height/period certificates, modular symbols, registered operators and typed result claims.\n- Preserve 25 newly executed P7 records with 25 fresh matching replays and negative controls; retain raw failure diagnostics.\n- Add the independently reviewed full-Haar SU(2) reference-scale and a/L/T studies, with archived source receipts, visible uncertainty and unresolved continuum scope.\n- Add the actual source-connected Fluid pressure/C5/signed-stress construction and finite Fourier flow observations; correct physical/display/angle units and path semantics.\n- Expose source-bound Worker execution, replay, original-data tables and per-observable proof boundaries in the existing public page.\n\n## Validation and assessment\n\nThe frozen source passed 155 P7/API tests. The actual Fluid source construction passed 7/7 tests (897.813 seconds); the fast source suite passed 18/18. The newly built Worker/display suite passed 21/21. P7 mutation execution passed 9/9 locally. Fresh CI on head `529e864c8b2ed19399bab8bbc53a08721873d5d4` passed all six workflows. The synthetic child-failure fixture now includes the five mandatory PARI recipe files; production source binding remains strict. P7 CI passed 161 API/regression tests, 233 P7 numerical/replay tests and 117 JavaScript tests. The failed prior CI artifact is retained as a failed attempt.\n\nThe current progress snapshot is 31 complete, 14 awaiting final current CI/API/UI gates, and 19 with concrete remaining implementation/proof obligations. This PR does not claim all 64 criteria complete or universal RH/BSD, continuum Yang-Mills, or full Navier source completion.\n\nThe cumulative PR targets main so the bounded P7 backend can deploy with its required pinned PARI runtime. The original M0/M1/M2 files and historical 56-criterion report remain unchanged.\n\nLive page: https://project29770.websitepublisher.ai/v0.3.1.html\n","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:33:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:43:43Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T10:43:43Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T10:43:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"3eb8427c6031dddded7d6d1b6527221cdb292017","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_